<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-split">
<h1>Help us reach the first 100 mothers.</h1>
<div>
<p class="lead">Give, volunteer, or spread the word. Every part of a kit, from the iron tablets to the handwritten card, depends on people like you.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="{{ site.donateUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><a class="btn ghost" href="#contact">Contact us</a></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="ways" id="donate"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Ways to give</h2>
<p class="sub">About $5 covers one mother&rsquo;s kit: iron tablets for her pregnancy, two health guides in her language, and a handwritten card.</p>
<div class="give">
<div class="give-main"><h3>Give online</h3><p>A secure donation page. You can give once or monthly, and 100% of your gift reaches Heartlines International.</p><a class="btn primary" href="{{ site.donateUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate online<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><p class="small">Heartlines International is a 501(c)(3) public charity (EIN 42-4681667). Gifts are tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law.</p></div>
<div class="give-other">
<p><strong>Give by check.</strong> Make checks payable to &ldquo;Heartlines International.&rdquo; <a href="#contact">Send us a message</a> for the mailing address.</p>
<p><strong>Ask about a match.</strong> Many employers match gifts to 501(c)(3) charities like ours. Ask your employer, or <a href="#contact">send us a message</a> and we&rsquo;ll help.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section id="volunteer"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Volunteer</h2>
<p class="sub">Write cards, help pack kits, or help with outreach. No experience needed: we train every volunteer, including on writing with cultural sensitivity. Sign up with our short form, and we&rsquo;ll email you about the next card-writing session.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="{{ site.volunteerFormUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sign up to volunteer<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><a class="btn ghost" href="#contact">Ask us a question</a></div>
</div></section>

<section id="share"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Spread the word</h2>
<p class="sub">Most of our support comes from people telling people. Three easy ways to help:</p>
<div class="cols3">
<div><h3>Share our story</h3><p>Send our About page to a friend or post it to your story.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="about.html">Read our story</a></div>
<div><h3>Follow and share</h3><p>Follow us on Instagram and share a post that means something to you.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="{{ site.instagramUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div>
<div><h3>Bring a group</h3><p>Ask your club, team, or youth group to write cards with us.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="#contact">Message us</a></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section id="contact"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Contact us</h2>
<p class="sub">Questions, partnerships, or volunteering: we&rsquo;d love to hear from you.</p>
<p class="sent-note" id="sent" role="status">Thank you! Your message is on its way. We&rsquo;ll reply by email soon.</p>
<div class="contact-grid">
<form class="contact-form" action="{{ site.formAction }}" method="POST">
<input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New message from the Heartlines International website">
<input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/get-involved.html#sent">
<input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false">
<input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table">
<p class="hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this empty <input type="text" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></p>
<div class="field-row">
<div class="field"><label for="f-name">Your name</label><input id="f-name" type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100" required></div>
<div class="field"><label for="f-email">Your email</label><input id="f-email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="200" placeholder="name@example.com" pattern="[^@\s]+@[^@\s]+\.[A-Za-z]{2,}" title="A full email address, like name@example.com" aria-describedby="email-hint" required><p class="hint" id="email-hint">We reply here, so please double-check it.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="field"><label for="f-topic">What is it about?</label><select id="f-topic" name="topic"><option>Volunteering</option><option>Giving or a check</option><option>Partnerships</option><option>Something else</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="f-message">Message</label><textarea id="f-message" name="message" rows="6" maxlength="3000" required></textarea></div>
<div class="form-end"><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Send message</button><p class="small">We use what you send only to reply to you.</p></div>
</form>
<div class="contact-ways">
<p class="way-h">Or reach us directly</p>
<div class="way"><p class="way-label">Email</p>{% set em = site.email.split("@") %}<p class="way-value">{{ em[0] }}@<wbr>{{ em[1] }}</p></div>
<div class="way"><p class="way-label">Instagram</p><a class="way-value" href="{{ site.instagramUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@heartlinesinternational<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>
